      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;the-revelation-of-oneness-part-1-jeff-foster&#34;&gt;The Revelation of Oneness (Part 1) Jeff Foster&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;part-2-will-provide-extracts-from-dialogs-in-the-above-book&#34;&gt;Part 2 will provide extracts from dialogs in the above book.&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Source: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/discourses/teachers/oneness1_foster.htm&#34;&gt;TW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Author: Jeff Foster&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0955399971/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/revelation_foster.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/revelation_foster.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;book cover&#34; title=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This is Part 1 of extracts from Jeff&amp;rsquo;s book &amp;lsquo;The Revelation of Oneness: Dialogues on Nonduality and Spiritual Awakening&amp;rsquo;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Purchase from &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0955829046/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;Amazon.com&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.co.uk/exec/obidos/ASIN/0955829046/thespiritupat-21&#34;&gt;Amazon.co.uk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Link to &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.lifewithoutacentre.com&#34;&gt;Jeff&amp;rsquo;s website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Introduction:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A QUIET REVOLUTION IN SPIRITUALITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;**Jesus said to them:&lt;br&gt;&#xA;****“When you make the two one,&lt;br&gt;&#xA;****And when you make the inside like the outside&lt;br&gt;&#xA;****And the outside like the inside,&lt;br&gt;&#xA;**&lt;strong&gt;Then will you enter the Kingdom.”&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
